# Copy to .env.local (that name is git-ignored) and fill in a key ONLY if you want the
# on-site assistant to answer with a live model in addition to the local knowledge base.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# WARNING: a key placed here is injected into client-side code by Vite and is therefore PUBLIC
# to every visitor of the site. Use a restricted key (HTTP-referrer limited to your own domain,
# low quota) or leave it empty — the site is fully functional without it.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
